 947:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC.c **** *
 948:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC.c **** * Summary:
 949:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC.c **** *  Converts the ADC counts output to mVolts as a 16-bit integer. For
